From 0d2a5b3d9ea2e2065cfbe7280b3a056f53a62575 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:54:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/18] :bug: Repair Linux workspace lint and formatting checks

Use the project mutex for diagnostic deduplication and a nonzero divisor
for the guest-page log. Route host cache ages through the Linux clock
service while preserving CLOCK_MONOTONIC awake-time semantics. Keep the
guest clock sleep-inclusive and leave reclamation intervals unchanged.

Apply the workspace formatter to the existing baseline differences so
the strict gate can reach compilation and tests with CMake installed.
